<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><ix:nonNumeric name="oef:ExpensesTextBlock" contextRef="C000182865_ClassMember" escape="true" id="ixv-1152"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:16px;color:#368627;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">What were your Fund costs for the last year?</span>
