</td>
<td valign="bottom" style="width:27%; background-color:#dfe0e4;border:1px solid #dfe0e4;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;"><div style="text-align:center;text-align-last:auto;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:11px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Costs paid as a percentage of a $10,000 investment </span></div>
</td>
