<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:AnnlOrSemiAnnlStatementTextBlock" id="ixv-3138"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">This </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:ShareholderReportAnnualOrSemiAnnual" id="ixv-3140"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">annual</span><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> shareholder report</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> contains information about Fidelity&#174; Contrafund&#174; for the period January 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025.</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:AddlInfoTextBlock" id="ixv-3145"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">You can find additional information about the Fund at </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:AddlInfoWebsite" id="ixv-3147"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">fundresearch.fidelity.com/prospectus/sec</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. You can also request this information by contacting us at </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:AddlInfoPhoneNumber" id="ixv-3150"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">1-800-835-5092</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> or by sending an e-mail to </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" name="oef:AddlInfoEmail" id="ixv-3153"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">fidfunddocuments@fidelity.com</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">.</span></ix:nonNumeric></div>
