<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><ix:nonNumeric name="oef:ExpensesTextBlock" contextRef="C000064233_ClassMember" escape="true" id="ixv-3160"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:16px;color:#368627;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">What were your Fund costs for the last year?</span>
