nt-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> or by sending an e-mail to </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="C000016600_ClassMember" name="oef:AddlInfoEmail" id="ixv-6275"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">fidfunddocuments@fidelity.com</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Sans';font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">.</span></ix:nonNumeric></div>
