</td><td style="width:166.333; margin-top:0px; padding-left:9.6px; padding-top:0px; padding-right:9.6px; padding-bottom:0px"><p style="text-align:right; margin:0px; font-size:12pt">$13,852,100 </p>
</td><td style="width:180; margin-top:0px; padding-left:9.6px; padding-top:0px; padding-right:9.6px; padding-bottom:0px"><p style="text-align:right; margin:0px; font-size:12pt">$15,401,000 </p>
