</td>
<td valign="top" style="width:17%; "><div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:1px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Centry Std Light Cond';font-size:13px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</span><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Condensed Light',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Discount rate </span></div>
</td>
