</td>
<td valign="top" style="width:17%; "><div style="text-align:right;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:3px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Condensed Bold',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Total net realized gain or loss on Investments ($)</span></div>
</td>
