</td>
<td valign="top" style="width:17%; "><div style="text-align:right;text-align-last:auto;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Condensed Light',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">15,284,218,825</span></div>
</td>
