<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><div id="Sec_Item8_ANIF-ANN"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Bold',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:19px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Item 8: Changes in and Disagreements with Accountants for Open-End Management Investment Companies</span></div></div>
<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;"></div>
<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Bold',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:19px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</span></div>
