<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;"></div>
<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Bold',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:19px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</span></div>
<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-top:6px;margin-right:6px;"><span style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Condensed Light',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;line-height:14px;">Note: This is not applicable for any fund included in this document.</span></div>
